Cyclotomic readout:
- Gal(Q(zeta_7)/Q) ~= (Z/7)^* ~= (Z/14)^* is C6.
- quotient by conjugation +/-1 gives the C3 action on binder slots.
- the order-3 subgroup fixes the quadratic field Q(sqrt(-7)).
- therefore the C3 slot action and Q(sqrt(-7)) are complementary
  projections of the same C6 cyclotomic package, not rival scalars.

