readout: doubling stays in the even covering branch and raises v2 by 1; it changes residue 12 mod 14 to 10 mod 14, so it is a magnitude sidecar rather than a residue-only quotient

## Proof-route theorem target
1. prove one binding-pair lemma, then C3-transport it to all three slots
2. split the covering layer into even cover residues and the ramified apex 7
3. classify magnitude-side flex inside the covering branch; 12->24 is the live hinge
4. glue residue and magnitude layers through the HYP-3300 observability/Morse packet
5. route failures to strict off-grid bulk, covering floor, finite chamber discharge, or named debt

